{"episodes":{"211809":"Another Spring storm brought mountain snow, rain and thunderstorms to the area from April 20th through April 22nd. There were numerous reports of roadway flooding due to heavy rain and thunderstorms. There was also a report of a rock slide on State Route 16 from the heavy rain with rocks all over the road. Moderate mountain snow brought periods of chain controls over the mountain highways.","212434":"A few strong to severe thunderstorm developed along a backdoor cold front and producing hail in southeastern WI.","213061":"Persistent isentropic lift generated showers and thunderstorms that led to excessive rainfall and flash flooding.","213230":"Scattered thunderstorms develop over far southeast WI with the passage of an upper level disturbance and the approach of a weak cold front. A couple storms produced large hail."},"events":[{"begin":"2026-04-21T07:12Z","county":"Yolo","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2026-04-21T16:12Z","endLat":38.5586,"endLon":-121.6531,"episode":211809,"id":1331052,"injuries":0,"lat":38.56,"location":"2.14 NNW Swingle","lon":-121.64,"narrative":"California Highway Patrol reported a flooded roadway at Eastbound Interstate 80 and Road 32A from heavy rain.","source":"Department of Highways","state":"CA","type":"Flood","wfo":"STO"},{"begin":"2026-04-21T07:53Z","county":"Sacramento","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2026-04-21T16:53Z","endLat":38.6436,"endLon":-121.3851,"episode":211809,"id":1331053,"injuries":0,"lat":38.65,"location":"1.38 N Arcade","lon":-121.38,"narrative":"California Highway Patrol reported the Auburn Boulevard onramp to southbound 51/Business 80 had standing water in the roadway from heavy rain.","source":"Department of Highways","state":"CA","type":"Flood","wfo":"STO"},{"begin":"2026-04-21T09:54Z","county":"San Joaquin","damageCrops":"0.00K","damageProperty":"0.00K","deaths":0,"end":"2026-04-21T18:54Z","endLat":37.9908,"endLon":-121.1901,"